{"id":"n26702-4-7","stage":3,"title":"울리다 · 打动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26702-4-7-1","ko":"이 소설은 감동적이에요.","zh":"这部小说真感人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"소설은","meaning":"小说","explanation":"소설：小说；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"1","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소설은","audio":"/audio/6cbfce6909c1fb724051.mp3"}},{"text":"감동적이에요.","meaning":"感人的，动人的","explanation":"감동적：感人的，动人的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"감동적","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15451","senseId":"1","lemma":"감동적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감동적이에요","audio":"/audio/2e95e0283557604b4055.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"作家虚构出来的、以故事形式写成的文学作品。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"b5ac8c4d76903cbd","term":"감동적","zh":"感人的，动人的","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3","entryId":"15451","definition":"有强烈感受后心动的。","pronunciation":["감ː동적"]}],"audio":"/audio/02c8fb67eb80075519b2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26702-4-7-2","ko":"맞아요. 읽는 내내 마음을 찡하게 울리더라고요.","zh":"对啊，读的时候一直让人的心很触动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{